{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105160","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110516001:1":{"text":"지혜를 발휘해 한마음 한뜻으로 거미들을 물리쳤군! 축하하네!","source_cn":"恭喜诸位运用智慧和团结合作，击败了那些蜘蛛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EED656A3228AAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110516002:1":{"text":"이 문으로 들어가면 증표를 받을 수 있네.","source_cn":"请进入这扇大门，收下属于你们的信物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFC34FC18C196564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110516003:1":{"text":"영령이... 사라졌어?","source_cn":"英灵……消失了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB129A6E486FB2A94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110516004:1":{"text":"가자, 증표를 받으러 가는 게 더 중요해.","source_cn":"走吧，先去拿信物要紧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC98C53EE8502EF63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110516005:1":{"text":"세스 님, 안 가세요?","source_cn":"赛特斯大人，不进去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB85FC0A3C1FA85C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110516006:1":{"text":"이번 관문의 승자는 너희들이야. 그러니 증표는 너희들이 가져가야지.","source_cn":"这次的胜利者是你们，自然该你们拿到战利品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC654579FC31F8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110516007:1":{"text":"패배를 인정하는 건 나약한 것이 아니라 규칙을 받아들이고 존중한다는 의미이지. 깨끗하게 승복하겠네.","source_cn":"认输并非懦弱，而是对规则的尊重。我尊重结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E0CDA298E27896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110516008:1":{"text":"용자는 가는 길이 달라도 결국 만나게 되어 있어. 전투에 목말라 있는 강자는... 언젠간 다시 만나게 될 거야.","source_cn":"勇者之道，殊途同归。追求战斗的强者……终会在某处再见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC640F0EEB8A99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1110516008":{"text":"용자는 가는 길이 달라도 결국 만나게 되어 있어. 전투에 목말라 있는 강자는... 언젠간 다시 만나게 될 거야.","source_cn":"勇者之道，殊途同归。追求战斗的强者……终会在某处再见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC640F0EEB8A99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110516009:1":{"text":"부인하고 싶지는 않네.","source_cn":"我倒是不否认这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1653EB877952E46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110516010:1":{"text":"세스 님의 대한 내 감정이 갑자기 복잡해졌어...","source_cn":"我对赛特斯大人的心情突然复杂起来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BBAB2E1DC15B4AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110516011:1":{"text":"세스랑 제대로 겨뤄볼 참이었는데, 정말 의외인걸.","source_cn":"真是意外。我本来都做好跟他再打一架的准备了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99423F25A4A3CF99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110516012:1":{"text":"그러게 말이야. 나도 저렇게 나올 줄은 몰랐어. 됐어, 어서 증표나 가지러 가자!","source_cn":"我也是，真没想到。不想了，去拿信物咯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA19BC2A9556FCB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"가버렸어...","source_cn":"走掉了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x89F4225037498ECF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"가버렸어...","female":"가버렸어...","variant_male_record_index":"63578","variant_female_record_index":"63579","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"멋진 말을 남기고 가버렸네...","source_cn":"留下很帅的话后走掉了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8385B09B5F51392D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멋진 말을 남기고 가버렸네...","female":"멋진 말을 남기고 가버렸네...","variant_male_record_index":"63580","variant_female_record_index":"63581","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:智慧的英灵":{"text":"지혜로운 영령","